 {tag:'RI.2.3 Connections',q:'Why must the molds be made very carefully?',a:'So the bricks will snap together',w:['So the bricks will be bright','So the plastic melts faster','So the machine can run all night'],ev:['If a mold is off by even a tiny bit, the bricks will not snap together'],clue:'Read the last paragraph.',why:'If a mold is even a tiny bit off, the bricks will not snap together.'}
